{"title":"Color Photography of Paris From 1914","link":"https://kottke.org/25/05/color-photography-of-paris-from-1914-1","date":1747338314000,"content":"\n        <p>Albert Kahn sent photographers all over the world in the early 1900s and amassed over 72,000 color photos in the process. Here are <a href=\"http://visualhistory.livejournal.com/51055.html\">a few shots of his from Paris</a> on the eve of World War I.</p>\n\n<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/albert-kahn-paris.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/albert-kahn-paris.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/albert-kahn-paris.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"640\" height=\"459\" alt=\"Albert Kahn Paris\" /></p>\n\n<p>That photo is of the entrance to the Passage du Caire at the corner of Rue d’Alexandrie and Rue Sainte-Foy in the 2nd arrondissement. Here’s what it looks like today:</p>\n\n<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/passage-du-caire.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/passage-du-caire.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/passage-du-caire.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"640\" height=\"466\" alt=\"Passage Du Caire\" /></p>\n\n         <p><em>[This is a vintage post originally from Dec 2012.]</em></p>\n\n         <p><strong>Tags:</strong> <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/Albert%20Kahn\">Albert Kahn</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/early%20color%20photography\">early color photography</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/Paris\">Paris</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/photography\">photography</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/timeless%20posts\">timeless posts</a></p>\n\n        \n\n    ","author":"Jason Kottke","siteTitle":"Kottke","siteHash":"89a883271b4598f9b33ebe87be70d38557bcd266e68aee521a8f93622e0ab723","entryHash":"0cd9ccdeb6b7f365da9fc96ac6e4980c94883d7c0edbb10fd5d582eb3b9848ec","category":"Sites"}